<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Parkway Properties raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Parkway Properties raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said it upgraded Parkway Properties Inc to buy from attractive.</p>
<p>-- analyst Jonathon Litt was not available to provide additional details.</p>
<p>-- Parkway gained 1-5/16 to 30-15/16.</p>
